Third-party and data notices
----------------------------

web/vendor/cytoscape.min.js is Cytoscape.js, Copyright (c) The Cytoscape
Consortium, used under the MIT License. It is vendored rather than loaded from
a CDN so the demo runs with no network access.

The synthetic layer of the graph is original to this project. The human layer
is derived from public GitHub API data (commits, pull requests and contributor
logins for a public repository), used under GitHub's API terms and reduced to
logins with no email addresses retained.
